---
// Toast Notification Overlay
---
<div id="toast" class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 transform transition-all duration-200 translate-y-12 opacity-0 pointer-events-none">
  <div id="toast-body" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200/80 bg-white text-xs font-mono shadow-xl backdrop-blur-md flex items-center gap-2.5 text-gray-900">
    <span id="toast-icon">⚡</span>
    <span id="toast-msg">Operation completed</span>
  </div>
</div>
